{"task_id":"487","citation_id":"TASK-API-0283","subject":"field_description sin translate= mientras la referencia lo declara translate=True","description":"Cap. 11 del Cookbook, desenlace (a) — bug de una línea. `api: src/addons/base/models/ir_model.py:414` declara `field_description` como `fields.Char` SIN el kwarg `translate=`; la referencia lo declara `translate=True` (`odoo19c: addons/base/models/ir_model.py:525`). El despachador de `Char()` ya sabe anotar la bandera —lo hace en otros 19 usos del árbol— así que es una omisión, no una capacidad ausente, y nada la bloquea.\n\nImporta porque `field_description` es precisamente donde aterrizan las traducciones de etiquetas de campo al importar un .po (lo documenta la propia receta del capítulo). Sin la bandera, ese destino queda fuera del motor de traducción antes de empezar a construirlo.\n\n[VM-b501 contractual integration] Functional responsibility: backend; operational owner VM-b501 is the user-identified execution context, not a separate local-model worker. One translate=True keyword and the three existing source-branch tests applied to the API working tree; real-path pytest3PASS with DB prohibited. Char executable factory matches target HEAD. Exact two-file index extraction attempted through normal hooks: commit exit1, no commit created; full-index style debt26326 findings, changed source76 identical diagnostic fingerprints before/after, new test stylePASS. Initial URLConf SECRET_KEY precondition resolved independently via existing wrapper:246patternsPASS, no DB; reference checker configured at pinned Odoo revision measured0calls, not whole coverage. No gate bypass, closure, merge or managed inference. Review evidence: Docs existing auditar-estado-vm-y-continuidad-20261016T100835/trazabilidad-20261027 outputs/babok-continuation-*; code remains uncommitted pending required style/policy resolution. Editing reservations released after preservation; reacquire before further edits.\n\n[Controlled publication2026-10-29] Published bounded contract2026-10-29: commit78520aae93bb3ccee634b773d28dc4b9160d8452 in PR109, confirmed remote descendant0ce23373ad0f36d2bba9918b583126079702f7ae. Only field_description translate=True declaration layout and its67-line test committed; unrelated working tree preserved. Three prior passing tests reused with executable AST/hash provenance. Ordinary real hooks exit0; initial rejected inherited suppression and changed logical-call E501 retained as negative evidence. Odoo19Community authority abe4040ec1a45beee90fb694e4eae4453e46b389 unchanged. Functional responsibility backend; ownerVM-b501 unchanged. Global CI remains separate, latest run in progress; no multilingual persistence, merge or acceptance.","status":"pending","owner":"VM-b501","blocked_by":[],"blocks":[],"blocked":false}
{"task_id":"737","citation_id":"TASK-API-0382","subject":"Mecanismo: la instalación se decide por base, no por proceso (H-API-784)","description":"Medido 2026-08-21 (H-API-784): `ir_module_module.state` existe y su propio help_text declara \"Derivado de INSTALLED_APPS; no hay instalador que lo escriba\". `grep -rn IrModule src/config/ src/orm/` → 0 hits. La dirección está invertida respecto a la referencia, donde `odoo/modules/db.py:88` ESCRIBE el estado y el cargador lo LEE, por base.\n\nConsecuencia: dos bases no pueden diferir en qué addons tienen instalados, porque INSTALLED_APPS es del proceso.\n\nEmparenta con #456 (H-API-654, installable: False sin efecto en la carga) y #449 (sembrar el registro de módulos) — las tres son la misma carencia vista desde tres sitios.\n\nBloqueada por la decisión de #443 sobre el reparto.\n\nContractual continuation2026-10-25: native TaskGet443 confirms TASK-API-0264 completed; the description above saying blocked by that decision is historical, not an active blocker. Current source09974556 Registry.new retains install/upgrade/reinit arguments but calls only _ensure_seeded; Registry.load adds imported app models, and Environment.registry returns the global module. These source observations do not demonstrate per-database effective model composition or loader execution. Whole loader remains unaccepted; no new coordinator, completed-state fabrication or blanket absence claim. Existing graph/loading reconciliation and AS IS remain the authorities; registry-dependency-native-443.json and registry-continuation-native-tasks.json preserve identity evidence. Historical #342 is not present in the checked legacy session; no replacement identity invented.\n\nBounded readiness unit2026-10-26: pinned Registry.new invokes load_modules183 before readyTrue210. Current Consumer retains lifecycle request arguments but does not execute loader, then returns readyTrue and replaces cached registry. Native frontier admits pure unsupported-request rejection before replacement, preserving existing no-request metadata registry behavior and RLock. Verify update/install/upgrade/reinit/demo/model-check requests cannot report readiness, previous registry/cache survives, no load/default result fabrication and no DB side effects. This unit does not implement or accept full per-base model composition, installer, hooks, versions or isolation; unaccepted full-loader dependencies are not fabricated. No source edits while fiscal4b29 full gate runs. No official state/owner/dependency or local inference change.\n\nBounded guard sourceec089c9a hooksPASS: qualified RED7FAIL30PASS; GREEN37PASS and real factory probe rejected request/preserved prior object; PostgreSQL registry family143PASS. Empty-request behavior and RLock preserved. No installed-state, loader, per-base composition or Task acceptance claimed; shared621aaf83 required gate currentlyRUNNING. Contract14 registry-readiness-contract-14.json retains exact source/consumers/limits.\n\nVerified checkpoint after required621aaf83 gate:2224PASS1SKIP1FAIL901.47s Make2/Pytest1; first legacy analytic prefix metadata assertion reproduced093. Actual PostgreSQL introspection confirms no physical prefix column, metadata private/nonconcrete registration correct; full analytic file4FAIL11PASS also exposes default_get route. Native0305in_progress ownerNULL is not available: owner-only proposal saved and requested, not executed; no analytic source/test edits. Exact original64 replay621 confirms20PASS44FAIL with zero result identity changes, current0397/0417/0418/0419 ownersNULL preserved. Existing QA harness completed0; exact new database/role/HBA independently absent0/0/0. Completed source editing claims released, evidence job retained. No whole task/Registry/ORM acceptance, official state change, merge or managed local inference; publication verification follows source checkpoint.\n\n[2026-10-27 root pruning diagnostics] Reference abe4040ec1a45beee90fb694e4eae4453e46b389 exposes root di